  - kind: 2
    emotion: smug
    text: So you're the new boy. I'm Councilor Crowley. There's a notice in your
      folder about the bread I sent to the orphanage. Make sure it's on the page
      today.
    giftId: 
    amount: 1
    optionA: Space costs extra.
    optionB: I print what fits.
